                <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#path5">Foreign Studies</button></h2>
                <div id="path5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#pathAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">
                  US / UK / Germany / Australia / Canada — country selection, IELTS/TOEFL, GRE prep, visa &amp; scholarship guidance via alumni network.
